{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch graph and SwiftUI are both reactive dataflow. Swami targets SwiftUI’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state graph (computed properties, "},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"withAnimation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") rather than imperative"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"functions, so the two graphs stay aligned. Where a native SwiftUI construct maps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cleanly, Swami uses it. Where Origami’s semantics need a helper — for example the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Interaction patch’s four discrete output ports, or Drag’s momentum + rubber-band"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"physics — Swami ships a helper named after the Origami patch and shaped like it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Corpus (69 patterns)","anchor":"Corpus-69-patterns"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The translated corpus is the gallery and the training set. Each entry is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verified SwiftUI translation of an Origami pattern."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Interaction","anchor":"Interaction"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"doc:Interaction_Touch","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swami"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"title":"Swami","externalID":"Swami","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Beats"],"anchor":"Reference","title":"Reference"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Drag"],"anchor":"Helpers","title":"Helpers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/TouchOrigamiExampleView","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"],"anchor":"Examples","title":"Examples"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"],"anchor":"Articles","title":"Articles","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/SwiftUICore"],"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"